sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User / CLI
  participant M as Model (lithora-recon)
  participant C as PlateCircuit
  participant S as RotationSequence
  participant R as Rotation (lithora-geo)
  U->>M: reconstruct_point(point, plate, age)
  M->>C: total_rotation(plate, anchor, age)
  loop up the parent chain
    C->>S: rotation_at(age)
    S->>S: bracket samples, slerp
    S-->>C: interpolated finite rotation
    C->>R: acc.then(link_rotation)
  end
  C-->>M: total rotation to anchor
  M->>R: rotation.apply(point unit vector)
  R-->>M: moved unit vector
  M-->>U: reconstructed LatLon
